        "text": "Managing Users and Groups\nWhether you support a Linux system with hundreds of users, or just have a\nuser account for you and one for your cat, you need to know how to manage user\naccounts. This section walks through the basics you need to know to manage user\naccounts on your Linux system.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Finding the right tool\n\u2022 Adding new users\n\u2022 Adding new groups\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
